/work/

# Personal radio programming data belongs outside this public repository.
# Only the sanctioned synthetic fixture may live in data/; anything else there
# is assumed to be a real export. scripts/check-public-data.mjs additionally
# refuses to build if codeplug-shaped JSON appears anywhere else in the tree.
/data/*.json
!/data/sample-codeplug.json
*.[cC][sS][vV]
/local-data/
/private/
*.rdt
*.RDT
*.lst
*.LST
Channel.CSV
RadioIDList.CSV
ReceiveGroupCallList.CSV
ScanList.CSV
TalkGroups.CSV
Zone.CSV
